    <footnotes>
        <footnote id="F1">The disposition and acquisition rows reflect the same bona fide gift of 29,787 ordinary shares, which was made by the reporting person and his spouse to a trust established for the benefit of members of the reporting person's family, with the trust subsequently contributing the shares to its wholly owned Third Delaware 2011, LLC, and such shares are included in the LLC holdings reported herein. The reporting person disclaims beneficial ownership of any shares held by the trust and LLC, except to the extent of his pecuniary interest therein.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F2">The shares acquired automatically vested pursuant to an award of performance share units (PSUs), with each PSU representing Cimpress' commitment to issue one ordinary share following the determination of the number of shares issuable pursuant to the award based on the level of achievement against the performance conditions.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F3">Includes 28,375 shares held by RHS Delaware Holdings LLC, of which Eastern Irrevocable, LLC and Western Irrevocable, LLC are the sole owners.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F4">These PSUs vest over the following four-year period: 25% of the number of shares determined to be issuable pursuant to the award based on the level of achievement against the performance conditions vest on the Date Exercisable shown in Table II and 6.25% of such number of shares vest quarterly thereafter.</footnote>
    </footnotes>

